<title>ESTONIA: Estonian trade deficit falls in January.</title>
<headline>Estonian trade deficit falls in January.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's trade deficit decreased to 1.17 billion kroons in January from a December 1996 level of 2.0 billion kroons, the statistics office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>   ESTONIAN TRADE BALANCE    Jan '97     Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p>  Exports			  2.4	  2.3	   1.7</p>
<p>  Imports			  3.6	  4.3	   2.5</p>
<p>  Balance			 -1.2	  -2.0	  -0.76</p>
<p>NOTE -- All figures are in billions of kroons unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or REUTERS@REUTERS.EE</p>
</text>
